ame>Wiedswang</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kvalheim</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Karesen</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Presence of bone marrow micrometastasis is associated with different recurrence risk within molecular subtypes of breast cancer</article-title><source>Mol Oncol</source><year>2007</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>160</fpage><lpage>171</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.molonc.2007.03.004</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>